<title>USA: Dare County, N.C., to vote on $59.5 mln GO bonds.</title>
<headline>Dare County, N.C., to vote on $59.5 mln GO bonds.</headline>
<dateline>MANTEO, N.C. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Carolina's Dare County has scheduled a May 20 referendum on a $59.5 million general obligation bond issue for schools, county officials said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Proceeds would be used to finance construction of a new high school and elementary school, land acquisition for future schools, and renovations and improvements systemwide.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
</text>
